    "biography": {
      "concept": "Circuit Rider recovery specialist, travelling with Captain Robot's column (Act 2-3)",
      "notes": "Howard recovers things for the Circuit Riders: people, machines, signal towers, and plans that turned out to have opinions. He is broad and patient and looks like he could carry an engine block, because he can. He says what an alliance costs before he says what it gives, and always waits a moment before he answers. His line on friendship gets quoted: your emergency is allowed to become mine without first becoming a transaction."
    }
